== Effects ==
* Taking damage has a {{dlc|nr+}} 2% / {{dlc|r+}} 5% chance to destroy the trinket and spawn a random [[item]] using the [[Item Pool|item pool]] of the current room.

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Adds +5% chance to destroy the trinket upon taking damage per copy.
* {{t|Wish Bone|nr}}: Two copies cannot be held at the same time.

