== Trivia ==
* The wishbone is the [[wikipedia:Furcula|furcula]] of the turkey, which is eaten during [[wikipedia:Thanksgiving (United States)|Thanksgiving]]. It's tradition for two people to break the wishbone by holding one end each and pulling. The one that gets the bigger end gets to make a wish.

